                            "steamid": "76561199536125235",
                            "num_reviews": 19,
                            "playtime_forever": 655,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 47,
                            "playtime_at_review": 655,
                            "last_played": 1793385247
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Behind the cartoonish graphics lie some of the most brutal moments in history. This game isn’t about the Allies or Germany; it’s about people—ordinary, simple human beings. There are no winners in war: everyone loses something. We all deserve to live in peace, because, in the end, we are all human. It is an excellent game. The way both French and German military leaders are portrayed in the same light is simply brilliant. For me, this is now one of the best games I have ever played. Peace to the whole world—I’m writing this from Russia. I hope that, one day, everyone will have peaceful skies above them.",
